  (text "JFOX-FCU - 3-board TMR system.\\nFMU-A/B/C are three instances of ONE sheet (fmu-v2/). Editing it\\nedits all three; KiCad keeps their reference designators distinct via the\\nper-instance paths. CAN_H/CAN_L/GND/SAFETY are global labels because all\\nthree boards genuinely share those nets. Power and servo signals are\\nhierarchical pins so each board's stay separate - which is the entire point." (at 25.4 20.32 0)
